y=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, we have the following system:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"412\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-v class=\"mjx-c7B\" style=\"height: 4em; vertical-align: -1.75em;\"><mjx-beg><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-beg><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-mid><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-mid><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end><mjx-mark></mjx-mark></mjx-stretchy-v></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 3.561em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-bottom: 0.25em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-m